# OpenBrain local stack — health-check the two native MCP systemd units and
# re-apply docker restart policies (every 3 min). Edge runtime retired 2026-07-29.
*/3 * * * * /home/dave/AIHUB/OB1/ops/ob-watchdog.sh
# OpenBrain one-way mirror (every 15 min): push local -> cloud (delete-reconcile + upsert).
# No scheduled pull: capture is local-only, and pulling full rows blew the egress quota (2026-09-11).
*/15 * * * * /home/dave/AIHUB/OB1/ops/ob-sync.sh push >> /home/dave/AIHUB/OB1/ops/sync.log 2>&1
# The nightly backup (00:30) and dream (01:00) moved to systemd user timers
# ob1-backup.timer / ob1-dream.timer (Persistent=true: a night the machine was
# off runs at next boot; cron silently skipped those). See ops/systemd/ and the
# README's "Install the schedule".
